    "4": {
      "note": "`worktreeStatus` maps a worktree row through shared `taskStatusKey`/`statusTone`, returns `idle` when unbound, and maps `wait` to `warn`, `gone` to `idle`, otherwise `ok`. `worktreeFields` supplies the label, status word and full limit detail using shared status/limit helpers; a limited node's detail contains the word plus every `limitLines` row, with no canvas clock. `buildTopology` creates only workspace, repository and worktree nodes: workspace is `core`, `addRepositories` supplies repository `ok`, and worktrees use that shared derived status and those fields. Search-provider satellites and their status mapping are absent.",
      "targets": [
